{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02220",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.81,
      "end_seconds": 3.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.25,
      "end_seconds": 8.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.77,
      "end_seconds": 11.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.49,
      "end_seconds": 16.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Right, I've been dealing with yellow eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.83,
      "end_seconds": 20.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.2,
      "end_seconds": 27.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say. Oh, and dark urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.57,
      "end_seconds": 33.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Have you had yellow eyes before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.6,
      "end_seconds": 39.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.6,
      "end_seconds": 60.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.63,
      "end_seconds": 76.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Okay, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.66,
      "end_seconds": 104.23,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.9 degrees, blood pressure 121 over 70, respiratory rate 15, pulse is 85 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.34,
      "end_seconds": 110.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.94,
      "end_seconds": 115.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Alright, stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.39,
      "end_seconds": 139.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "The whites of the eyes are yellow and the liver edge is tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.41,
      "end_seconds": 143.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.88,
      "end_seconds": 154.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Did you get confusion, vomiting blood, high fever or itching?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.83,
      "end_seconds": 159.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.15,
      "end_seconds": 165.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.65,
      "end_seconds": 168.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.29,
      "end_seconds": 173.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Alright, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.94,
      "end_seconds": 176.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.72,
      "end_seconds": 180.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.27,
      "end_seconds": 185.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Hmm, no, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.66,
      "end_seconds": 206.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.99,
      "end_seconds": 211.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.3,
      "end_seconds": 219.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Alright, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.12,
      "end_seconds": 221.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "I have epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.41,
      "end_seconds": 232.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Okay, I can see epilepsy in your file as well. Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.76,
      "end_seconds": 240.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, no, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.09,
      "end_seconds": 247.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.79,
      "end_seconds": 260.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.63,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.99,
      "end_seconds": 284.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, it points towards acute hepatitis, possibly hepatitis A after travel. I'd also keep a gallstone blockage in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.34,
      "end_seconds": 290.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.13,
      "end_seconds": 307.73,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's acute hepatitis, possibly hepatitis A after travel, and we'll know more once the a hepatitis screen is back. A hepatitis screen is what I'd like next, for jaundice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.62,
      "end_seconds": 311.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.87,
      "end_seconds": 327.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.83,
      "text": "Rest, avoid alcohol and wash your hands carefully, as it can spread. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.67,
      "end_seconds": 331.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}